# Consumer setup for @jsmillerucsd/supabase-sso (GitHub Packages).
#
# Add this one line to your app's .npmrc. The repo is public, so no PAT or
# login is required — npm just needs to know which registry serves the scope.
#
# Then: npm i @jsmillerucsd/supabase-sso
@jsmillerucsd:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
